{"id":"01a046b0-1ee5-7dcb-bafd-50e1b58b8b60","issue_id":"project-LICHEN-worker6-7bd5.3","event_type":"closed","actor":"Mark Atwood","old_value":"","new_value":"The behavior is intentional per spec. Test vectors in loadng_messages.json explicitly require acceptance of nonzero undefined flags (rreq_nonzero_flags with flags=2, rerr_nonzero_flags with flags=0x80). The spec follows RFC 6550 guidance: 'receivers MUST ignore reserved flags' (spec/05-routing.md line 455). The code correctly preserves unknown flags for forward compatibility and round-trip fidelity. No validation should be added.","created_at":"2026-08-28T04:45:42.501905Z"}
